  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A circuit consists of three identical lamps connected to a battery as shown in the figure. When the switch <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math> is closed then the intensities of lamps&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math></p>\r\r<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0007_f50d3eda41c2.jpg\" style=\"width: 312px; height: 169px;\" /></p>\r"
  },
